From ba32a6471d77994cc253eab5d79a2a65894ad246 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chandavath <rcrajagopal@habana.ai>
Date: Wed, 11 Dec 2024 12:29:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-210370] preboot rtos: integrate fit verify from emb cmn mods

fit verify, security file is being refactored and added
in emb common mods to verify the fit signature, image hashes
at eROM, zephyr-plugins, zephyr-apps/preboot.

Here, integrating fit verify files to zephyr-apps/preboot
and remove the redundant functions.

Change-Id: Id0ad311f79b37df043e6f2f5655dd33f4779f1a7
Signed-off-by: chandavath <rcrajagopal@habana.ai>
---

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index b5c2f66..3cade4d 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -102,6 +102,9 @@
 zephyr_library_sources(emb_common_mod/lib/common/lib_common.c)
 zephyr_library_sources(emb_common_mod/lib/common/pci.c)
 zephyr_library_sources(emb_common_mod/lib/common/fit_utils.c)
+zephyr_library_sources(emb_common_mod/lib/common/fit_verify.c)
+zephyr_library_sources(emb_common_mod/lib/common/fit_error.c)
+zephyr_library_sources(emb_common_mod/lib/preboot/security.c)
 zephyr_library_sources(emb_common_mod/lib/preboot/fit.c)
 zephyr_library_sources(emb_common_mod/lib/preboot/fit_rsa.c)
 zephyr_library_sources(emb_common_mod/lib/preboot/fit_regions.c)
